06:04.200 --> 06:06.769
Or the specific priorities of this

06:06.769 --> 06:08.491
administration . For example ,

06:08.491 --> 06:10.491
implementation of the cybersecurity

06:10.491 --> 06:12.658
maturity model certification process ,

06:12.658 --> 06:14.602
improving the authority to operate

06:14.602 --> 06:16.658
process for software to be placed on

06:16.658 --> 06:18.769
the DOD networks , and addressing the

06:18.769 --> 06:21.100
backlog of technical debt in our IT

06:21.100 --> 06:23.267
programs to make sure our networks are

06:23.267 --> 06:25.378
more modern , more resilient , and of

06:25.378 --> 06:27.799
