06:29.966 --> 06:31.743
common cause and desire to work

06:31.743 --> 06:33.910
together to improve the department for

06:33.910 --> 06:35.688
the long term . We want to work

06:35.688 --> 06:37.688
collaboratively , collaboratively ,

06:37.688 --> 06:39.855
excuse me , with you on these issues .

06:39.855 --> 06:41.966
However , the department has not been

06:41.966 --> 06:44.739
