06:44.739 --> 06:46.906
information . So for us to conduct our

06:46.906 --> 06:49.017
statutory , a statutory obligation to

06:49.017 --> 06:50.906
oversee the Department of Defense

06:50.906 --> 06:53.510
requires us to have open and honest

06:53.510 --> 06:55.732
conversations . Um , there's definitely

06:55.732 --> 06:57.954
a trust deficit right now , but I think

06:57.954 --> 07:00.066
