07:26.508 --> 07:28.674
Paul Stanton , um , United States Army

07:28.674 --> 07:30.841
Director , Defense Information Systems

07:30.841 --> 07:32.952
Agency commander of the Department of

07:32.952 --> 07:35.008
Defense , Cyber Defense Command . We

07:35.008 --> 07:37.119
welcome both of you here , uh , and ,

07:37.119 --> 07:39.174
uh , we look forward to your opening

07:39.174 --> 07:40.897
statements . Uh , your written

07:40.897 --> 07:43.230
