07:43.230 --> 07:45.119
but we would welcome your opening

07:45.119 --> 07:47.286
statements . And with this , uh , Ms .

07:47.286 --> 07:49.519
Davies , would you like to begin ? Uh ,

07:49.529 --> 07:51.418
thank you . Uh , good afternoon ,

07:51.418 --> 07:53.418
Chairman , Ranking Member , Senator

07:53.418 --> 07:55.085
Reid . Uh , thank you for the

07:55.085 --> 07:57.085
opportunity to speak with you today

07:57.085 --> 07:59.029
about the department's strategy to

07:59.029 --> 08:01.196
transform technology and cybersecurity

08:01.196 --> 08:03.418
into a decisive warfighting advantage .

08:03.418 --> 08:05.529
Our focus is to enable data supremacy

08:05.529 --> 08:07.751
and decision dominance on the contested

08:07.751 --> 08:09.862
battlefields of today and tomorrow at

08:09.862 --> 08:11.862
the speed and scale our warfighters

08:11.862 --> 08:13.973
deserve . In the latest initiative in

08:13.973 --> 08:16.140
Secretary Hegseth Drive for Efficiency

08:16.140 --> 08:18.307
and Effectiveness , we are undertaking

08:18.307 --> 08:20.473
a bold transformation of enterprise IT

08:20.473 --> 08:22.251
and the cybersecurity program ,

08:22.251 --> 08:24.450
unifying these capabilities under the

08:24.450 --> 08:26.728
department's Chief Information Officer .

08:26.728 --> 08:28.950
Through this effort , we will eliminate

08:28.950 --> 08:31.172
inefficient spending , reduce technical

08:31.172 --> 08:33.394
debt , accelerate modernization , drive

08:33.394 --> 08:35.617
consistent and up-level cybersecurity ,

08:35.650 --> 08:37.706
and unleash data and innovation from

08:37.706 --> 08:39.945
the core to the edge across our . Joint

08:39.945 --> 08:42.424
Forces leveraging my oversight of DISA ,

08:42.625 --> 08:45.155
the NSA cybersecurity Directorate , and

08:45.155 --> 08:47.266
the Department's Cyber Crime Center ,

08:47.385 --> 08:49.218
we are working with the military

08:49.218 --> 08:51.163
services , joint staff , combatant

08:51.163 --> 08:53.655
commands , and defense agencies across

08:53.655 --> 08:55.984
four transformation pillars . I'll

08:55.984 --> 08:58.095
provide a few highlights here . Under

08:58.095 --> 08:59.984
Pillar one , the enduring digital

08:59.984 --> 09:02.049
Foundation , we're transforming our

09:02.049 --> 09:03.549
network infrastructure and

09:03.549 --> 09:05.771
communications transport , which extend

09:05.771 --> 09:07.771
from undersea cables to terrestrial

09:07.771 --> 09:09.327
fiber to advanced satellite

09:09.327 --> 09:11.382
capabilities , connecting everything

09:11.382 --> 09:13.382
from the home front to the tactical

09:13.382 --> 09:15.493
edge . This foundation supports every

09:15.493 --> 09:17.438
war fighting system and our global

09:17.438 --> 09:19.660
installations . We're driving continual

09:19.660 --> 09:21.438
modernization , expansion . and

09:21.438 --> 09:23.822
hardening , as well as broad 5G usage

09:23.822 --> 09:26.221
and data center modernization . We're

09:26.221 --> 09:28.901
evolving our cloud , our cloud strategy

09:28.901 --> 09:31.861
in JWCC next , and we're also leading a

09:31.861 --> 09:33.583
proactive approach to spectrum

09:33.583 --> 09:36.052
management and advancing PNT efforts ,

09:36.302 --> 09:37.981
ensuring ready and resilient

09:37.981 --> 09:40.062
capabilities that enable American

09:40.062 --> 09:42.461
warfighting dominance . Under pillar

09:42.461 --> 09:44.953
two , fragile digital capabilities

09:44.953 --> 09:46.786
reflecting some of your comments

09:46.786 --> 09:49.064
centered around . We are expanding our ,

09:49.064 --> 09:51.231
our , and maturing digital offerings .

09:51.231 --> 09:53.453
We're accelerating delivery of software

09:53.453 --> 09:56.234
and SAS services and standardizing data

09:56.234 --> 09:58.473
architectures , streamlining our data

09:58.473 --> 10:01.434
flows . We're shifting from slow legacy

10:01.434 --> 10:04.833
software development to modern agile

10:04.833 --> 10:07.565
delivery driving Interoperability by

10:07.565 --> 10:09.732
design and delivering applications and

10:09.732 --> 10:11.843
analytics at the speed of relevance .

10:11.843 --> 10:13.621
We're driving extensive defense

10:13.621 --> 10:15.398
business systems work , whether

10:15.398 --> 10:18.435
modernizing or sunsetting those systems

10:18.445 --> 10:20.334
to enable clean audits and reduce

10:20.334 --> 10:22.445
wasteful spend . We're also deploying

10:22.445 --> 10:24.223
mission partner environments as

10:24.223 --> 10:26.389
persistent , secure environments where

10:26.389 --> 10:28.167
trusted partners can be rapidly

10:28.167 --> 10:30.260
integrated . Under Pillar 3 ,

10:30.340 --> 10:32.229
cybersecurity for the warfighting

10:32.229 --> 10:34.451
ecosystem , in alignment with President

10:34.451 --> 10:36.619
Trump's national security strategy and

10:36.619 --> 10:39.140
the national defense strategy , we're

10:39.140 --> 10:41.479
moving from checklist-driven compliance

10:41.859 --> 10:44.739
towards unified , holistic , risk-based

10:44.739 --> 10:47.070
approach . We will emphasize automation

10:47.070 --> 10:49.292
and dynamic and continuous monitoring .

10:49.460 --> 10:51.780
We will drive risk reduction rather

10:51.780 --> 10:54.179
than burdensome paperwork , focusing on

10:54.179 --> 10:56.401
anti-fragility . and resilience through

10:56.401 --> 10:58.372
a holistic blend of streamlined

10:58.372 --> 11:01.382
processes , advanced technologies , and

11:01.382 --> 11:03.382
skilled people . We're refining the

11:03.382 --> 11:05.215
authority to operate process and

11:05.215 --> 11:07.215
accelerating our deployment of zero

11:07.215 --> 11:09.382
trust principles . We're also refining

11:09.382 --> 11:11.160
our risk management process and

11:11.160 --> 11:13.302
reigniting the dib to align with the

11:13.302 --> 11:15.024
Secretary's arsenal of freedom

11:15.024 --> 11:17.343
initiatives . Finally , through Pillar

11:17.343 --> 11:20.143
4 , skills and partnerships , we

11:20.143 --> 11:22.466
recognize That people are our decisive

11:22.466 --> 11:24.705
edge . As part of our transformation ,

11:24.825 --> 11:27.745
we're reviewing IT and cybersecurity

11:27.745 --> 11:30.205
